<title>NETHERLANDS: Elsag Bailey Q1 diluted net loss narrows.</title>
<headline>Elsag Bailey Q1 diluted net loss narrows.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM, the Netherlands 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Elsag Bailey Process Automation N.V.</p>
<p>		CONSOLIDATED STATEMENT OF INCOME (UNAUDITED)</p>
<p>		  (Amounts in thousands, except share data)</p>
<p>						For the quarter ended</p>
<p>					     :::::::::::::::::::::</p>
<p>					March 25, 1997   March 25, 1996</p>
<p>					 ::::::::::::::   ::::::::::::::</p>
<p>Revenues			    $     345,726    $     372,099</p>
<p>Net loss			    $	(6,531)   $     (98,104)</p>
<p>Net loss per share:</p>
<p>     Primary			$	 (0.22)   $	 (3.52)</p>
<p>Assuming conversion of the</p>
<p>	preferred shares(1)     $	 (0.07)   $	 (2.56)</p>
<p>Weighted average number of shares outstanding:</p>
<p>     Primary			   29,184,000	27,886,000</p>
<p>Assuming conversion of the</p>
<p>	preferred shares(1)	  38,140,000	36,840,000</p>
<p>Note: (1)  Preferred shares are anti-dilutive</p>
<p>Fully diluted current Q1 net applicable to common shareholders, before non-recurring charges of $4.2 million, or $0.11 per share, was profit $1.4 million, or $0.04 per share, versus net loss of $3.1 million, or $0.08 per share in the first quarter 1996.</p>
